 .
 ocompiler (1-5+209) xenial; urgency=medium
 .
   * otoc add prototype to call function b in a and viceversa (recursive call all around)
Author: bc <bc@bc-desktop>

---
The information above should follow the Patch Tagging Guidelines, please
